{"id":"68427bc628af9b8d","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md","title":"Lebesgue Measure","display":"df-lebesgue — Lebesgue Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-lebesgue","aliases":["58-df-lebesgue"],"display":"df-lebesgue — Lebesgue Measure","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-lebesgue"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-lebesgue</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lebesgue — Lebesgue Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,E\\subseteq\\mathbb R\">\\(A,E\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda^*:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R)\\to[0,\\infty]\">\\(\\lambda^*:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R)\\to[0,\\infty]\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}outer}\\vdash\n\\lambda^*(A)\\coloneqq\n\\inf\\left\\{\n\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}(b_n-a_n):\n\\begin{array}{l}\na,b\\in\\mathbb R^\\omega,\\quad\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(a_n\\leq b_n),\\\\\nA\\subseteq\\displaystyle\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}(a_n,b_n)\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}outer}\\vdash\n\\lambda^*(A)\\coloneqq\n\\inf\\left\\{\n\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}(b_n-a_n):\n\\begin{array}{l}\na,b\\in\\mathbb R^\\omega,\\quad\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(a_n\\leq b_n),\\\\\nA\\subseteq\\displaystyle\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}(a_n,b_n)\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}measurable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land\n\\forall E\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n\\bigl(\\lambda^*(E)=\\lambda^*(E\\cap A)+\\lambda^*(E\\setminus A)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}measurable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land\n\\forall E\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n\\bigl(\\lambda^*(E)=\\lambda^*(E\\cap A)+\\lambda^*(E\\setminus A)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S(\\lambda,\\mathcal L,\\mathbb R)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal L=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(A)\\}\n\\land\\lambda:\\mathcal L\\to[0,\\infty]\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal L\\;(\\lambda(A)=\\lambda^*(A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S(\\lambda,\\mathcal L,\\mathbb R)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal L=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(A)\\}\n\\land\\lambda:\\mathcal L\\to[0,\\infty]\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal L\\;(\\lambda(A)=\\lambda^*(A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Carathéodory measurability produces a sigma-algebra <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span>, and restricting the outer measure to it produces Lebesgue measure.</li>\n<li>The former ideal and cardinal dependencies were unrelated to this construction.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,E\\subseteq\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda^*:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R)\\to[0,\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}outer}\\vdash\n\\lambda^*(A)\\coloneqq\n\\inf\\left\\{\n\\sum_{n\\in\\omega}(b_n-a_n):\n\\begin{array}{l}\na,b\\in\\mathbb R^\\omega,\\quad\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(a_n\\leq b_n),\\\\\nA\\subseteq\\displaystyle\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}(a_n,b_n)\n\\end{array}\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}measurable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nA\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land\n\\forall E\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\n\\bigl(\\lambda^*(E)=\\lambda^*(E\\cap A)+\\lambda^*(E\\setminus A)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}lebesgue\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S(\\lambda,\\mathcal L,\\mathbb R)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal L=\\{A\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(A)\\}\n\\land\\lambda:\\mathcal L\\to[0,\\infty]\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal L\\;(\\lambda(A)=\\lambda^*(A)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false}],"bytes":1550,"backlinks":[{"id":"8107070d99d9c69c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S$ (Lebesgue-measurability predicate, see [[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]])"},{"id":"15e11a9a63f56ef5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"857c580ef52511af","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bda18e5a40f416fb","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b91a21e76d0947e0","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d7bfcf5788937844","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bee0665ec95eaa96","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S(\\lambda,\\mathcal L,\\mathbb R)\\land[0,1)\\in\\mathcal L\\land\\lambda([0,1))=1$ (see [[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]])"},{"id":"952055ea38b3b9ae","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S(m,\\mathcal L,\\mathbb R)$ (see [[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]])"},{"id":"17b0691a6d971aa3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\lambda:\\mathcal P([0,1])\\rightharpoonup[0,\\infty]$ (Lebesgue measure, see [[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]])"},{"id":"1fb6ef473fb89132","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(B)$ (Carathéodory measurability, see [[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]])"},{"id":"935f5eb1f0ba4a25","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S(A)$ (Carathéodory measurability, see [[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]])"},{"id":"3b8b3b1a1bbba5e8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\lambda^*:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R)\\to[0,\\infty]$, $\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]])"},{"id":"61015b29c34a1c82","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\lambda^*:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R)\\to[0,\\infty]$ (Lebesgue outer measure, see [[58-df-lebesgue]])"},{"id":"1b528408f2c37ce3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mu$ (Lebesgue measure on $\\mathbb R$, see [[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue]])"},{"id":"6cd8ac9e1db76366","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"923ca3856ded4fd3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (Lebesgue 测度谓词, see [[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]])"},{"id":"016ffefd9b733e65","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasurable}_S$ and $\\lambda^*$ are the Lebesgue-measurability predicate and Lebesgue outer measure from [[58-df-lebesgue]]"},{"id":"3cb5355dfd837c8e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-767","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md|58-df-lebesgue]]（batch10）"}],"ou